Package: svent-core
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: feh, x11-xserver-utils, svent-artwork
Description: Svent OS system tool, tool catalog engine, and wallpaper selector
 Provides the svent command, the tool catalog engine that merges per-tool
 catalog fragments from /usr/share/svent/catalog.d, the menu generator driven
 by a dpkg trigger, the doctor health checks, and the shared svent-wallpaper
 selector used by the desktop sessions.